<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-076" chapter-id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng" source-id="s-jinshu-076-wangleng">
  <p id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line092" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line092:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABFA">棱</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line092:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABFA">文子</persName>，<persName id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line092:m0005" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDB">彬</persName>季父國子祭酒<persName id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line092:m0012" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABF">琛</persName>之子也。少曆清官。渡江，為<persName id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line092:m0026" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA">元帝</persName>丞相從事中郎。從兄<persName id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line092:m0037" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">導</persName>以<persName id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line092:m0039" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABFA">棱</persName>有政事，宜守大郡，乃出為豫章太守，加廣武將軍。<persName id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line092:m0063" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABFA">棱</persName>知從兄<persName id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line092:m0067" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABBA">敦</persName>驕傲自負，有罔上心，日夕諫諍，以為宜自抑損，推崇盟主，且群從一門，並相與服事，應務相崇高，以隆勳業。每言苦切。<persName id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line092:m0123" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABBA">敦</persName>不能容，潛使人害之。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line094" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">弟<persName id="c-jinshu-076-wangleng:line094:m0001" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABFB">侃</persName>，亦知名，少曆顯職，位至吳國內史。</p>
</text>
